# CR 702.22c: a band is one or more attacking creatures with banding and up to one without - however many have banding. Bot1
# attacks with Benalish Hero and Mesa Pegasus (banding), Guerrilla Gorilla and Llanowar Elves (not). Asked for the Hero's band,
# Bot1 can't take both creatures without banding - refused - but takes the Pegasus and the Gorilla: two with banding and one
# without. The Pegasus is in a band now, so nothing more is asked, and the Elves attack alone. Nothing blocks; all four deal
# their damage: 1 + 1 + 2 + 1.

